 for the genetic background of quantitative traits</article-title><source>Genet Sel Evol</source><year>2001</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>3</fpage><lpage>16</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11268311</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1051/gse:2001107</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Raftery</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name><name><surname>Lewis</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Bernardo JM, Berger JO, Dawid AP, Smith AFM</surname></name></person-group><article-title>How many iterations in the Gibbs sampler?</article-title><source>Bayesian Statistics IV</source><year>1992</year><publisher-name>Oxford, Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>763</fpage><lpage>773</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Gene Expression Omnibus</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karaman</surname><given-names>MW</given-names></name><name><surname>Houck</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Chemnick</surname><given-names>LG</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagpal</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Chawannakul</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sudano</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Pike</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ho</surname><given-names>VV</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryder</surname><given-names>OA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hacia</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparative analysis of gene-expression patterns in human and African great ape</article-title><source>Genome Res</source><year>2